Subject: [PATCH] Fix linting and TypeScript errors in deployment pipeline

- Fix syntax error in data/site-config.ts by adding missing export statement
- Escape unescaped HTML entities in JSX (quotes and apostrophes)
- Replace `any` type usage with proper TypeScript types:
  - Update SearchFilters to use specific string types
  - Add interfaces for ModerationPanel data structures
  - Use Record<string, unknown> for Firestore document data
  - Use Anthropic SDK types for API responses
  - Type analysis function parameters properly
- Fixes 34 ESLint errors blocking CI/CD deployment

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
